#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_member__method
msgid ""
"Consolidation method. Full: 100% of subsidiary balances roll up, NCI carved "
"out. Proportional: ownership% of balances roll up. Equity: subsidiary not "
"rolled up; instead, parent's share of subsidiary equity carried as a single "
"investment line."
msgstr ""
"Konsolideringsmetod. Fullständig: 100% av dotterbolagets saldon summeras, "
"med innehav utan bestämmande inflytande (NCI) utbrutet. Proportionell: "
"ägarandelen% av saldona summeras. Kapitalandel: dotterbolaget summeras inte;"
" i stället redovisas moderbolagets andel av dotterbolagets eget kapital som "
"en enda investeringsrad."

